==== Serial ====
-> [[docs:techref:hardware:port.serial]] General information about the serial port, serial port cable, etc.

The serial header is the J5 (below the heatsink) near the SoC. The pinout is the following:
<a2s>
   #-------#
 RX|.-. .-.|GND
  1|'-' '-'|2
   |       |
VCC|.-. .-.|GND
  3|'-' '-'|4
   |       |
 TX|.-. .-.|GND
  5|'-' '-'|6
   #-------#
      J5
</a2s>
