==== Interesting unpopulated parts ====
  * The MiniPCI connector
  * The U22 IC seems to be a SPI flash in SO16 wide package with this pinout:
 {{media:adb:spi_flash_so16.png|}} 
  * There is an unpopulated WAN port right to the LAN ports. Population options are present for two different media interface, but with the same pinout PHY in QFN32 package. (U7 on the top, and U4 on the bottom.) These PHYs looks like an MII PHY, but I have not found a pin compatible yet. 
The know pins can be seen on the following picture: (the P$[N] pins are unknown)

{{media:adb:unknown_mii_phy_pinout.png|}}

If you know a pin compatible one, please let us know. 
  * Unpopulated Smartcard reader.

